        "description": "USN-4589-1 fixed a vulnerability in containerd. This update provides the corresponding update for docker.io.  Original advisory details:  It was discovered that containerd could be made to expose sensitive information when processing URLs in container image manifests. A remote attacker could use this to trick the user and obtain the user's registry credentials.",
